"The <guilabel>General</guilabel> tab allows you to change the "
"<guilabel>Name:</guilabel> and <guilabel>Description:</guilabel>. The "
"<guilabel>Groups &amp; Threading</guilabel> tab allows you to configure "
"several elements to customize your aggregation."
