#. Tag: para
#: configure.docbook:2116
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Enable this option if you want to be asked for confirmation whenever you "
#| "use <menuchoice><guimenu>Folder</guimenu><guimenuitem>Move All Messages "
